# A nontoken permanent that is a copy of Enduring Curiosity has its dies ability (ruling 2024-11-08): Bot1's Phantasmal Image copies the
# Curiosity on turn 3. On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets the Image, whose own ability sacrifices it (it is a creature, so it "dies as a
# creature"); the copy's ability returns the card, Phantasmal Image, to the battlefield under its owner's control as an enchantment with no
# other card type. Bot1 declines to have it copy anything. Not a creature, it is not zero-toughness and stays. The Bolt then fizzles.

